  "_comment": [
    "Hand-authored stand-in for b1_read_shapes.jsx output, so the Python half",
    "of B1 is tested before AE is ever opened. Path vertices are already in",
    "LAYER space -- composing group transforms down is the script's job.",
    "Deliberately awkward: two layers SHARE A NAME (AE allows it, and 'Shape",
    "Layer 1' twice is the default), one layer is a ring drawn as two separate",
